In this project I have created an AMI and launched instance by using that AMI
====================================================

How to create an AMI

Create an instance or use an existing instance and select that instance 

Go to Actions => Image and templates => create image

It'll navigate here

Give Image name and description (optional)

If you want, you can add extra volume and select deletion on termination otherwise you have to raise query to customer care to delete it 

Click on create image 

Note : you can delete the existing instance only when the created image is in available state.

After that image turned into available state, you can create instance with that AMI

Click on launch instance give a name and got AMI => My AMIs

Click on 'Browse more AMI'

Now select the image you have create 

Now you can launch instance as we did before.
